AgentTelemetryGroupRow.description:
One group of a grouped series. ``key`` is null for the ``other`` fold and
for a real group whose column is NULL (e.g. a since-deleted user);
``is_other`` separates the two.

delete.description:
Delete a budget default.

The per-member ``scoped_budgets`` rows it already materialized are kept;
a member joining afterwards no longer gets one from it.
